  "description": {
    "text": "The Metal Modification Pack (钢属性改造包) holds cards for improving the Metal deck of the Battle Party Set. Its ten cards are Mawile-GX, Jirachi, Kartana-GX, Dusk Mane Necrozma, Rayquaza, Celesteela-GX, Rescue Stretcher, Metal Frying Pan, Choice Band and Apricorn Maker.\n\nModification packs (改造包) arrived on 13 January 2024 with Battle Party modification battles (改造赛). Pokémon made one pack for each of the Battle Party Set's eight decks; each held four random cards from its own list of ten. A player got the pack for the deck they drew and could swap any of its cards into that deck. From the same day the 64-player Battle Party King tournaments used this format too. The packs were not in the box when the Battle Party Set went on sale in shops in February 2024.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Battle Party modification battles begin in the New Year (8 January 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/event/15976.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Battle Party Set goes on sale for the New Year (31 January 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15951.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CSMPqC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 010",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: Battle Party modification battles begin in the New Year (8 January 2024)",
